# Frontend Architecture Rules

Use React + TypeScript + Vite + Ant Design + ProComponents + React Router + Zustand + ECharts.

Do not introduce another UI framework or frontend framework.

Rules:

- API calls go through api clients.
- Pages should not contain complex business logic.
- Use explicit TypeScript types.
- Handle loading, empty, error, and pagination.
- Shared components must stay business-neutral.
- Update `docs/UI_COMPONENT_CATALOG.md` when adding shared components.
